OL,3,GNEWSAHealthy food projects boosted with
OL,4,A#222k fund
OL,5,
OL,6,FFour councils in Lancashire have been
OL,7,Fselected for government funding to help
OL,8,Fimprove access to healthy and
OL,9,Faffordable food.
OL,11,FThe Good Food Neighbourhood Programme,
OL,12,Fannounced by Environment Secretary
OL,13,FAngela Eagles at the Labour Party
OL,14,FConference this week, will see #10m
OL,15,Finvested in the 45 areas in most need.
OL,17,FBlackpool, Pendle, Rossendale and
OL,18,FBurnley have all been granted #222,000
OL,19,Fto invest in community food projects.
OL,23,APub: 03-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,403,400,260,160,0,100
