OL,3,GNEWSAHealthy food projects boosted with
OL,4,A#222k fund
OL,5,
OL,6,FBlackpool Council's cabinet member for
OL,7,Fpublic health, Matthew Thomas, said
OL,8,F"food insecurity, health inequality and
OL,9,Fmore limited access to nutritious food
OL,10,Fare challenges faced by many of our
OL,11,Fresidents".
